  "title": "UK Obesity Research Institute Launches £72 Million Project to Understand Causes and Treatments of Obesity",
  "summary": "The United Kingdom has launched a major new research initiative aimed at tackling the growing obesity crisis affecting millions of people across the country. The new UK Obesity Research Institute will investigate the causes, health impacts, and possible treatments for obesity, with funding of up to £72 million from public investment. Researchers involved in the project say obesity is a complex health condition influenced by many different factors, including genetics, hormones, metabolism, brain",
